// Four named workspaces: General (the first one, where niri starts), Web, Media and Games. The window rules of 60-window-rules.kdl send apps
// to them; delete this file and its include line (and the open-on-workspace lines of the rules, which are then ignored) for niri's
// dynamic workspaces only. Reference: https://niri-wm.github.io/niri/Configuration:-Named-Workspaces
workspace "General"
workspace "Web"
workspace "Media"
workspace "Games"
